are) — nor whether the timer is introduced staged vs. immediately active on install.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"feb54d2821cdbafa5","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"'What invokes the reaper' / 'Scope' / Acceptance Criteria","norm_id":"n6311b459af72bed6","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Reaper begins removing containers unexpectedly in prod (e.g. a guard regression) and an operator needs a fast, documented way to halt it without editing shell","The three-way budget split proves wrong (e.g. images need >13 GiB) and needs quick reversion to the prior 15 GiB image share"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a short Rollback note: `systemctl disable --now rebar-container-reaper.timer` (or mask) halts the reaper with no data cleanup; reverting DOCKER_CONTAINER_WRITABLE_BYTES restores the two-way split — and add a runbook line for it alongside the existing diagnosis/remediation steps.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.1429,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"823bc5865f6f949d","material_parts":{"chil